{"title":"Career Roadmap · Media Planner","role":"Media Planner","summary":"A Media Planner develops strategies for where, when and how advertising or communication campaigns should reach target audiences. The role combines media research, audience insights, campaign strategy, budgeting, channel selection, performance analysis and communication planning.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Media Planner develops strategies for where, when and how advertising or communication campaigns should reach target audiences. The role combines media research, audience insights, campaign strategy, budgeting, channel selection, performance analysis and communication planning."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Media & Communication / Digital Media / Podcasting provides a relevant foundation in communication and digital content, but traditional media planning also requires stronger knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Media buying"},{"text":"Audience measurement"},{"text":"Digital advertising"},{"text":"Campaign analytics"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Performance marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The modern Media Planner increasingly works across TV, OTT, YouTube, social media, search, podcasts, websites, programmatic advertising and other digital channels."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Media & Advertising Foundation"},{"text":"BA + media research + analytics + advertising projects"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Media Planning Professional"},{"text":"Media Planner, Media Executive, Digital Media Planner"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Strategic Planning"},{"text":"Senior Media Planner, Media S