ment make the profile commercially valuable. Podcasting can become a useful specialist advantage through audio advertising, sponsorship planning and audience analytics. For long-term progression into strategic and managerial roles, postgraduate study in Marketing, Advertising, Media & Communication or Marketing Analytics can further strengthen the profile."}]}]}